# Consulting fees — Pinnacle Advisory Partners / Acme (SOW No. 2)

> Module Consulting_fees_pinnacle

Source: SYN-013 (Statement of Work No. 2, 2026-04-01). Acme is the customer here, which is
why this is its own module and cannot collide with the Acme-as-provider agreements.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope ConsultingFees:
  input hours content decimal
  input month_of_service content date
  input invoice_date content date

  output fees content money
  output fees_payable content money
  output change_order_required content boolean
  output eighty_percent_notice_required content boolean
  output invoice_payable content boolean
```

## SYN-013 § 3.1–3.3 — rate, ceiling, and the 80% notice

  Services are provided on a time-and-materials basis at a blended rate of two hundred
  twenty-five dollars ($225.00) per hour. The total fees payable under this Statement of
  Work shall not exceed one hundred twelve thousand five hundred dollars ($112,500.00),
  corresponding to five hundred (500) hours, without a written change order signed by
  Company. Consultant shall notify Company in writing when eighty percent (80%) of the
  amount in Section 3.2 has been incurred.

```catala
scope ConsultingFees:
  definition fees equals $225 * hours

  definition change_order_required equals fees > $112,500

  definition eighty_percent_notice_required equals fees >= $112,500 * 80%
```

## SYN-013 § 5.3 — the invoicing window

  Invoices submitted more than ninety (90) days after the end of the month in which the
  services were performed are not payable.

`month_of_service` is the first day of the month, so the end of that month is the day
before the first of the next one.

```catala
scope ConsultingFees:
  definition invoice_payable equals
    invoice_date <= ((month_of_service + 1 month) - 1 day) + 90 day
```

## What Acme can actually pay

The ceiling in § 3.2 caps the payable amount; anything above it waits for a change order,
and an out-of-time invoice is not payable at all.

```catala
scope ConsultingFees:
  definition fees_payable equals
    if not invoice_payable then $0
    else if fees > $112,500 then $112,500
    else fees
```
